    "body": "I'm not sure, but https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/1549 is nonzero and that is about a subset.\r\n\r\nWe should probably also consider sandboxing restricting this as you suggested, though I'm not sure if I want to tightly couple all those changes.",
